  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you press show avatar author on any avatar it will not open the correct section of the main menu to show you the avatar author. When you click show avatar author it simply brings you to the social tab. I've found the only way to actually get the correct screen to pop up is you have to be in the social search tab, close the main menu, then click on someone and show avatar author. Otherwise it just defaults to where you last were on the social menu.",
